[%# influxdb.service reads this file, because it has
    EnvironmentFile=-/etc/default/influxdb.  The package ships no such file, so
    this file is ours and not an edit of the configuration of another package.

    An INFLUXDB_ variable overrides the matching setting in influxdb.conf, so the
    19KB packaged configuration stays exactly as it came.  With nothing set,
    influxd reports bind-address = ":8086", which is every interface.  With this
    set, it reports 127.0.0.1:8086. -%]
INFLUXDB_HTTP_BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1:8086
